  abstract = {Sentiment classification is a key task of natural language processing and a long-term goal of artificial intelligence. In this paper, we propose a new approach, which combines the Attention Mechanism, Bidirectional Long Short-Term Memory Network, and Lexicons for sentiment classification. Experiments on the Movie Review and Stanford Sentiment Treebank datasets demonstrate that the performance of our approach is better than other approaches.},
